---A `InvType` config contains the descriptive data necessary for the game to populate an Inventory.
---
---These config types can be found within the `config.Inv` table:
---
---Info: An `InvType` is a Proxy usertype, which means it is safe to copy and store in your scripts. It cannot, however,
---be used with any persistent storage.
---
---Information available within an `InvType` includes:
---@class InvType
---@field id integer (Read-only) The ID of this config type.
---@field configName string (Read-only) The name of this config, i.e. `"METAL_BANK"`.
---@field typeName string (Read-only) The type of this config. Will always be `"Inv"`.
---@field size integer (Read-only) The number of inventory slots in this config.
---@field stockCount integer (Read-only) The number of stock ObjTypes in this config.
